69, 292.349, 291.6775, 291.7071, 292.1431, 292.6581, 293.7361, 293.7413, 294.0226, 293.664, 291.9551, 292.8222, 293.8012, 294.1288, 295.2536, 295.9381, 297.1932, 299.0199, 298.8005, 299.0081, 299.3239, 299.063, 299.1428, 299.009, 297.9249, 295.6214, 295.0105, 294.8155, 294.9054, 293.5176, 295.2414, 295.101, 294.8741, 295.6585, 296.2123, 296.9835, 296.3079, 296.702, 296.0401, 296.0823, 297.0166, 297.9523, 298.8858, 298.374, 299.0714, 301.1083, 301.1128, 302.072, 302.6345, 302.3854, 303.0077, 302.9211, 303.7728, 304.0621, 303.203, 303.4612, 304.4262, 304.9254, 306.0988, 304.7921, 303.9304, 302.4048, 301.8768, 301.9372, 302.3985, 302.6412, 302.4194, 302.7067, 303.6004, 303.9794, 304.7504, 304.8418, 304.7776, 303.4912, 302.1833, 302.5797, 301.1858, 303.3431, 303.8777, 307.1818, 308.7067, 310.0367, 310.9796, 309.1793, 310.7179, 311.6401, 312.8044, 316.3453, 315.7262, 318.871, 319.7988, 320.0895, 318.6999, 319.049, 317.6528, 315.8116, 315.5008, 318.2632, 318.0081, 316.445, 317.1992, 323.8167, 322.0447, 321.5626, 321.221, 321.7723, 320.7197, 319.1059, 318.5721, 318.9317, 318.4644, 318.4525, 320.6105, null], "summary_html": "<h1>The Dollar's Convenience Yield — Factor Summary</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>This paper draws an analogy between CIP deviations in currency markets (the dollar's convenience yield) and deviations from forward-spot parity in commodity markets. The key equation is <span class=\"math-tex\">F_{t,T} = S_t(1 + r + u - y)</span>, where <span class=\"math-tex\">y</span> is the convenience yield that arises when physical commodities are scarce. High convenience yield (backwardation) signals scarcity and holding value, while low/negative CY (contango) signals oversupply.</p>\n<p>We implement this as a cross-sectional carry/convenience yield factor applied to all Chinese commodity futures. The primary signal is the roll yield (ry), which directly measures the term structure slope — a real-data proxy for convenience yield. Commodities in backwardation (high ry, high CY) are bought; commodities in contango (negative ry) are sold. The factor is enhanced by combining it with basis (spot-futures gap) as a complementary scarcity measure, since both signals reflect the same underlying economic phenomenon of commodity scarcity.</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>1.53</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>6.2%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>4.1%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-6.2%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.03</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>3534</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.73</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>2.0</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.46 / 1.99</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2012</th><th>2013</th><th>2014</th><th>2015</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.57</span></td><td>1.2</td><td>0.71</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.5</span></td><td>1.38</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.75</span></td><td>0.97</td><td>0.76</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">3.27</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.72</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.18</span></td><td>0.95</td><td>1.1</td><td>1.62</td><td>1.79</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>ryminusema252</code></td><td>展期收益EMA</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>receipt</code></td><td>仓单</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每 20 个交易日</li>\n<li><strong>信号更新</strong>: 每日计算，每 20 天生效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>58</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>3536</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>99.0%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>40.7</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p><strong>Convenience Yield (from term structure):</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">y \\approx \\frac{S_t - F_{t,T}}{S_t} - (r + u) \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad \\text{proxy: } ry_t</div>\n<p><strong>Basis Signal:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{basis\\_ratio}_t = \\frac{\\text{basis}_t}{\\text{close}_t}</div>\n<p><strong>Cross-sectional ranking (for each factor <span class=\"math-tex\">f</span>):</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{rank}_{i,t} = \\frac{\\text{Rank}(f_{i,t})}{N_t} \\in [0,1]</div>\n<p><strong>Continuous long-short signal:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{signal}_{i,t} = (\\text{rank}_{i,t} - 0.5) \\times 2 \\in [-1, 1]</div>\n<p><strong>Equal-weight combo (CY + Basis):</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{combo}_{i,t} = \\frac{\\text{rank}^{cy}_{i,t} + \\text{rank}^{basis}_{i,t}}{2}</div>\n<p><strong>Volatility-scaled position:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{position}_{i,t} = \\text{signal}_{i,t} \\times \\frac{\\sigma_{target}}{\\hat{\\sigma}_{i,t} \\times \\sqrt{252}}</div>\n<h2>改进历程</h2>\n<p><strong>R1 (Sharpe 1.00)</strong>: Initial implementation with 5 individual factors (CY level, CY EMA252, CY momentum 20d/60d, basis ratio, hedging pressure) and 3 combo variants, using 5/10/20-day rebalance. Best variant was <code>cy_ema252_raw</code> — smoothed convenience yield (EMA 252) as a pure carry factor. Turnover was high (0.55 daily) due to short rebalance periods. All 5 gates passed from R1.</p>\n<p><strong>R2 (Sharpe 1.18, +18%)</strong>: Diagnosed high turnover and that cross-sectional signal was effective (IC=0.017) while time-series IC was near zero. Actions: (1) Increased default rebalance to 20 days to reduce turnover; (2) Added <code>sym_rolling_ic_gate</code> to filter weak symbols; (3) Added EMA-smoothed basis variant; (4) Enabled _cs/_ts normalization. The CY+Basis equal-weight combo emerged as the best (1.18), outperforming standalone CY (1.00). Turnover dropped from 0.55 to 0.31.</p>\n<p><strong>R3 (Sharpe 1.22, +3.4%)</strong>: Explored weighted combos and vol window sensitivity. Key finding: longer vol window (120 days vs 60) improved the CY+Basis combo by better estimating slower-moving commodity volatility regimes. Weighted combos did not improve significantly over equal-weight. Three-factor combo (adding hedge pressure) slightly underperformed the two-factor version. Final turnover: 0.29.</p>\n<p><strong>Key turning point</strong>: R2's combination of CY + Basis was the biggest improvement (+18%). The paper's theoretical insight that both convenience yield and basis reflect scarcity validated empirically — the two signals are complementary despite measuring related phenomena.</p>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Data frequency</strong>: Daily</li>\n<li><strong>Universe</strong>: All commodity futures (~49 liquid symbols with CY/basis data)</li>\n<li><strong>Holding period</strong>: ~20 trading days</li>\n<li><strong>Factor type</strong>: Cross-sectional carry/scarcity (primarily)</li>\n<li><strong>Known limitations</strong>:</li>\n</ul>  - Relies on <code>ry</code> and <code>basis</code> fields (37% and 28% non-null respectively); symbols without term structure data are excluded\n<p>- Time-series IC is low (~0.007) — this is fundamentally a cross-sectional factor, not a timing signal - Moderately correlated (0.79) with existing CY/basis factors in the library, but delivers higher Sharpe - Yearly Sharpe varies: strongest in 2018-2022, weaker in 2016-2017 and 2023-2025</p>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 0.63s</li>\n</ul>"}